; Gray-box floor 9 (CP-013). Meters; +X east, +Z north, +Y up; origin = center of Vera's threshold.
; Each container keeps its envelope in `Floor` (footprint, top at Y=0) and `Ceiling` (underside at Y=2.70).
; Walls sit OUTSIDE the envelope (10 cm) so measuring Floor/Ceiling gives the A.1 boxes.
